    """
    Takes as input a string encoded by shifting every lowercase English letter by 5 positions in the alphabet (as done by the encode_shift function). 
    Returns the decoded string by shifting each lowercase letter backward by 5 positions. 
    Characters outside the range 'a' to 'z' are preserved unchanged in the output.
